<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id" class="light">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Simplification of Context-Free Grammars — Peter Linz Bab 6</title>

  <!-- Google Fonts: Plus Jakarta Sans & JetBrains Mono -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:ital,wght@0,500;0,600;0,700;1,500&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />

  <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <script>
    tailwind.config = {
      darkMode: 'class',
      theme: {
        extend: {
          fontFamily: {
            sans: ['Plus Jakarta Sans', 'sans-serif'],
            mono: ['JetBrains Mono', 'monospace'],
          },
          colors: {
            brand: {
              indigo: '#4F46E5',
              violet: '#7C3AED',
              emerald: '#10B981',
              rose: '#F43F5E',
              amber: '#F59E0B',
            }
          }
        }
      }
    };
  </script>

  <!-- GSAP & MotionPathPlugin CDN -->
  <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/gsap.min.js"></script>
  <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/MotionPathPlugin.min.js"></script>

  <!-- Lucide Icons CDN -->
  <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest"></script>

  <style>
    :root {
      --dot-color: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.28);
      --glass-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
      --glass-border: rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.9);
      --svg-stage-bg: rgba(241, 245, 249, 0.72);
    }

    html.dark {
      --dot-color: rgba(51, 65, 85, 0.45);
      --glass-bg: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.78);
      --glass-border: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.95);
      --svg-stage-bg: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.65);
    }

    body {
      background-image: radial-gradient(var(--dot-color) 1.2px, transparent 1.2px);
      background-size: 24px 24px;
      overflow: hidden;
      user-select: none;
    }

    .glass-card {
      background: var(--glass-bg);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 45px -15px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08), 0 4px 16px -4px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
    }

    html.dark .glass-card {
      box-shadow: 0 24px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);
    }

    .svg-stage {
      background: var(--svg-stage-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    }

    .slide {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      max-width: 1280px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 2rem 3.5rem 3.25rem;
      opacity: 0;
      visibility: hidden;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .slide.active {
      opacity: 1;
      visibility: visible;
      pointer-events: auto;
    }

    .rule-pill {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
      border-radius: 0.5rem;
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: background-color 0.25s ease, color 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .slide {
        padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem 2.75rem;
        overflow-y: auto;
        justify-content: flex-start;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-900 dark:bg-slate-950 dark:text-slate-100 font-sans transition-colors duration-300">

  <!-- Minimalist Top-Right Controls (Theme & Fullscreen) -->
  <div class="fixed top-4 right-5 z-50 flex items-center gap-2">
    <button id="btn-theme" onclick="event.stopPropagation(); toggleTheme();" title="Ganti Tema (T)"
      class="p-2.5 rounded-xl glass-card text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 hover:text-indigo-600 dark:hover:text-indigo-400 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 transition-all cursor-pointer">
      <i data-lucide="moon" class="w-4 h-4 block dark:hidden"></i>
      <i data-lucide="sun" class="w-4 h-4 hidden dark:block"></i>
    </button>
    <button id="btn-fullscreen" onclick="event.stopPropagation(); toggleFullscreen();" title="Layar Penuh (F)"
      class="p-2.5 rounded-xl glass-card text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 hover:text-indigo-600 dark:hover:text-indigo-400 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 transition-all cursor-pointer">
      <i data-lucide="maximize-2" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
    </button>
  </div>

  <!-- Main Presentation Stage (Click empty space to advance slide) -->
  <main id="deck" class="relative w-screen h-screen cursor-pointer">

    <!-- ==================== SLIDE 1: COVER KINETIK ==================== -->
    <section class="slide active" id="slide-0">
      <div class="relative w-full h-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center">
        <!-- SVG Constellation Background -->
        <svg id="hero-constellation" class="w-full max-w-3xl h-56 mb-4 overflow-visible" viewBox="0 0 760 220">
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id="const-grad" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="0%">
              <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#4F46E5" stop-opacity="0.55" />
              <stop offset="50%" stop-color="#7C3AED" stop-opacity="0.75" />
              <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#10B981" stop-opacity="0.55" />
            </linearGradient>
          </defs>

          <!-- Pulsing Connection Lines -->
          <g stroke="url(#const-grad)" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-dasharray="6 6" class="const-line">
            <path d="M 380 48 L 220 115" />
            <path d="M 380 48 L 540 115" />
            <path d="M 220 115 L 115 178" />
            <path d="M 220 115 L 315 178" />
            <path d="M 540 115 L 445 178" />
            <path d="M 540 115 L 645 178" />
          </g>

          <!-- Floating CFG Constellation Nodes -->
          <g class="const-node" transform="translate(380, 48)">
            <circle r="28" class="fill-indigo-600 shadow-lg" />
            <text y="6" text-anchor="middle" fill="#FFFFFF" class="font-mono font-bold text-lg">S</text>
          </g>
          <g class="const-node" transform="translate(220, 115)">
            <circle r="24" class="fill-white dark:fill-slate-900 stroke-indigo-500" stroke-width="2.5" />
            <text y="6" text-anchor="middle" class="fill-indigo-600 dark:fill-indigo-400 font-mono font-bold text-base">A</text>
          </g>
          <g class="const-node" transform="translate(540, 115)">
            <circle r="24" class="fill-white dark:fill-slate-900 stroke-violet-500" stroke-width="2.5" />
            <text y="6" text-anchor="middle" class="fill-violet-600 dark:fill-violet-400 font-mono font-bold text-base">B</text>
          </g>
          <g class="const-node" transform="translate(115, 178)">
            <rect x="-20" y="-20" width="40" height="40" rx="12" class="fill-emerald-500/15 stroke-emerald-500" stroke-width="2" />
            <text y="6" text-anchor="middle" class="fill-emerald-600 dark:fill-emerald-400 font-mono font-bold text-base">a</text>
          </g>
          <g class="const-node" transform="translate(315, 178)">
            <rect x="-20" y="-20" width="40" height="40" rx="12" class="fill-rose-500/15 stroke-rose-500" stroke-width="2" />
            <text y="6" text-anchor="middle" class="fill-rose-600 dark:fill-rose-400 font-mono font-bold text-base">λ</text>
          </g>
          <g class="const-node" transform="translate(445, 178)">
            <rect x="-20" y="-20" width="40" height="40" rx="12" class="fill-emerald-500/15 stroke-emerald-500" stroke-width="2" />
            <text y="6" text-anchor="middle" class="fill-emerald-600 dark:fill-emerald-400 font-mono font-bold text-base">b</text>
          </g>
          <g class="const-node" transform="translate(645, 178)">
            <rect x="-22" y="-20" width="44" height="40" rx="12" class="fill-amber-500/15 stroke-amber-500" stroke-width="2" />
            <text y="6" text-anchor="middle" class="fill-amber-600 dark:fill-amber-400 font-mono font-bold text-sm">CNF</text>
          </g>
        </svg>

        <div class="hero-stagger inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">
          <i data-lucide="git-branch" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i>
          <span>Teori Bahasa & Otomata • Bab 6 Peter Linz</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="hero-stagger text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-[1.08] mb-4 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-indigo-700 to-violet-600 dark:from-white dark:via-indigo-300 dark:to-violet-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
          Simplification of<br />Context-Free Grammars
        </h1>

        <p class="hero-stagger text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed mb-7">
          Koreografi transformasi tata bahasa bebas konteks untuk mengeliminasi produksi kosong (<span class="font-mono font-semibold text-rose-500">λ</span>), produksi unit (<span class="font-mono font-semibold text-indigo-500">A → B</span>), dan simbol tak berguna tanpa mengubah <span class="font-mono font-semibold">L(G)</span>.
        </p>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==================== SLIDE 2: URUTAN WAJIB & EFEK DOMINO ==================== -->
    <section class="slide" id="slide-1">
      <div class="mb-5">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
          <span>Aturan Fundamental</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">Urutan Wajib & Efek Domino Transformasi</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-3xl">
          Setiap tahap pembersihan dapat memicu kemunculan anomali baru sehingga urutan eksekusi tidak boleh dibalik.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-card rounded-3xl p-6">
        <!-- Action Bar -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pb-5 mb-6 border-b border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
            <i data-lucide="workflow" class="w-4 h-4 text-indigo-500"></i>
            <span>Pipeline Penyederhanaan Berurutan</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <button id="btn-domino" onclick="event.stopPropagation(); runDominoSimulation();"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white font-bold text-sm shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/25 hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:scale-95 transition-all cursor-pointer">
              <i data-lucide="play" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
              <span>Simulasi Efek Domino</span>
            </button>
            <button id="btn-domino-reset" onclick="event.stopPropagation(); resetDominoSimulation();"
              class="hidden inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-200/80 dark:bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-300 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 font-bold text-sm transition-all cursor-pointer">
              <i data-lucide="rotate-ccw" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i>
              <span>Reset</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- SVG Pipeline + Cards -->
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 relative z-10">
            <!-- Stage 1 -->
            <div id="dom-card-1" class="rounded-2xl p-5 bg-white/80 dark:bg-slate-900/80 border-2 border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 transition-colors">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
                <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-rose-500/10 text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400 font-mono text-xs font-bold">TAHAP 01</span>
                <span class="font-mono font-bold text-rose-500 text-sm">A → λ</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-extrabold mb-1.5">Hapus λ-Productions</h3>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                Substitusi variabel <em>nullable</em> pada <span class="font-mono font-semibold">S → AB</span> menghasilkan kombinasi <span class="font-mono font-semibold text-indigo-500">S → A | B</span> (unit production baru!).
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Stage 2 -->
            <div id="dom-card-2" class="rounded-2xl p-5 bg-white/80 dark:bg-slate-900/80 border-2 border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 opacity-50 transition-colors">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
                <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 font-mono text-xs font-bold">TAHAP 02</span>
                <span class="font-mono font-bold text-indigo-500 text-sm">A → B</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-extrabold mb-1.5">Hapus Unit Productions</h3>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                Menyalin produksi non-unit secara transitif lalu memutus edge <span class="font-mono font-semibold">A → B</span>, yang sering membuat variabel menjadi terisolasi.
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Stage 3 -->
            <div id="dom-card-3" class="rounded-2xl p-5 bg-white/80 dark:bg-slate-900/80 border-2 border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 opacity-50 transition-colors">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
                <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-mono text-xs font-bold">TAHAP 03</span>
                <span class="font-mono font-bold text-emerald-500 text-sm">Useless</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-extrabold mb-1.5">Hapus Useless Productions</h3>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                Pembersihan final: buang variabel <em>non-generating</em> lalu pangkas seluruh variabel <em>unreachable</em> dari <span class="font-mono font-semibold">S</span>.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Energy Particle Bar -->
          <div class="hidden md:block mt-5 relative h-3 rounded-full bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-800 overflow-hidden">
            <div id="dom-energy-bar" class="h-full w-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-rose-500 via-indigo-500 to-emerald-500 rounded-full"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Warning Box on Reversed Order -->
        <div id="dom-warning" class="mt-5 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 flex items-start gap-3 opacity-80">
          <i data-lucide="alert-triangle" class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5"></i>
          <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            <strong class="text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400">Mengapa Urutan Tidak Boleh Terbalik?</strong>
            Jika Unit Productions dihapus <em>sebelum</em> <span class="font-mono">λ</span>-Productions, maka penghapusan <span class="font-mono">B → λ</span> pada <span class="font-mono">A → BC</span> akan memunculkan kembali unit production baru <span class="font-mono font-bold text-rose-500">A → C</span>!
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==================== SLIDE 3: ELIMINASI LAMBDA-PRODUCTIONS ==================== -->
    <section class="slide" id="slide-2">
      <div class="mb-5">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-rose-500/10 text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
          <span>Tahap 1 • Teorema 6.3</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">Eliminasi λ-Productions</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1 text-sm sm:text-base">
          Tarik seluruh variabel <em>nullable</em> (<span class="font-mono">V ⇒* λ</span>), bangkitkan kombinasi pengganti, lalu eliminasi aturan kosong.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-stretch">
        <!-- Left: Grammar Workspace -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 glass-card rounded-3xl p-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pb-4 mb-5 border-b border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800">
              <span class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Tata Bahasa G (λ ∉ L(G))</span>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <button id="btn-lam-step" onclick="event.stopPropagation(); nextLambdaStep();"
                  class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white font-bold text-sm shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/25 hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:scale-95 transition-all cursor-pointer">
                  <i data-lucide="play" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                  <span>Langkah 1: Deteksi Nullable</span>
                </button>
                <button id="btn-lam-reset" onclick="event.stopPropagation(); resetLambdaStep();"
                  class="hidden inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-200/80 dark:bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-300 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 font-bold text-sm transition-all cursor-pointer">
                  <i data-lucide="rotate-ccw" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i>
                  <span>Reset</span>
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Grammar Rules -->
            <div class="space-y-3.5 font-mono text-base sm:text-lg">
              <!-- Rule S -->
              <div id="lam-rule-S" class="p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-100/80 dark:bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
                <span id="lam-lhs-S" class="font-bold text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 mr-1">S →</span>
                <span class="rule-pill bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">aSb</span>
                <span>|</span>
                <span id="lam-s-ab" class="rule-pill bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">AB</span>
                <span id="lam-s-comb1" class="hidden rule-pill bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/30">| A</span>
                <span id="lam-s-comb2" class="hidden rule-pill bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/30">| B</span>
                <span id="lam-s-comb3" class="hidden rule-pill bg-rose-500/15 text-rose-500 border border-rose-500/30">| λ</span>
              </div>

              <!-- Rule A -->
              <div id="lam-rule-A" class="p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-100/80 dark:bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
                <span id="lam-lhs-A" class="font-bold text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 mr-1">A →</span>
                <span class="rule-pill bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">aA</span>
                <span id="lam-a-new" class="hidden rule-pill bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/30">| a</span>
                <span id="lam-a-lam" class="rule-pill bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">| λ</span>
              </div>

              <!-- Rule B -->
              <div id="lam-rule-B" class="p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-100/80 dark:bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
                <span id="lam-lhs-B" class="font-bold text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 mr-1">B →</span>
                <span class="rule-pill bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">bB</span>
                <span id="lam-b-new" class="hidden rule-pill bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/30">| b</span>
                <span id="lam-b-lam" class="rule-pill bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">| λ</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-5 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-2">
            <i data-lucide="info" class="w-4 h-4 text-indigo-500 shrink-0"></i>
            <span>Karena <span class="font-mono font-semibold">λ ∉ L(G)</span>, kombinasi kosong <span class="font-mono font-semibold">S → λ</span> tidak disertakan.</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: Nullable Container & Step Log -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-5 glass-card rounded-3xl p-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 block mb-2.5">Wadah Himpunan Nullable (V_N)</span>
            <div id="nullable-bucket" class="min-h-[84px] p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-100/90 dark:bg-slate-900/90 border-2 border-dashed border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 flex items-center gap-3 flex-wrap">
              <span id="nullable-placeholder" class="font-mono text-sm text-slate-400">V_N = { kosong }</span>
              <span id="nb-token-A" class="hidden px-4 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-amber-500 text-white font-mono font-bold text-base shadow-md">A</span>
              <span id="nb-token-B" class="hidden px-4 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-amber-500 text-white font-mono font-bold text-base shadow-md">B</span>
              <span id="nb-token-S" class="hidden px-4 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 text-white font-mono font-bold text-base shadow-md">S (via AB)</span>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-6">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 block mb-2">Log Transformasi</span>
              <p id="lam-log" class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                Klik <strong>"Langkah 1: Deteksi Nullable"</strong> untuk mengidentifikasi variabel yang dapat menurunkan string kosong <span class="font-mono">λ</span> baik secara langsung maupun tidak langsung.
              </p>
