    <!-- ==================== SLIDE 7: STUDI KASUS LENGKAP END-TO-END ==================== -->
    <section class="slide" id="slide-6">
      <div class="mb-5">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-violet-500/10 text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
          <span>Simulasi Terpadu End-to-End</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">Studi Kasus Penyederhanaan Lengkap</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1 text-sm sm:text-base">
          Transformasi menyeluruh satu tata bahasa mentah melewati seluruh 3 fase hingga siap dikonversi ke <strong>Chomsky Normal Form (CNF)</strong>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-stretch">
        <!-- Left: Animated Rules Deck -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 glass-card rounded-3xl p-6">
